// The debug world's score: 120 beats a minute in 4/4 (`score.music.json`). Every press the world judges is graded against
// this beat (the standard's rhythm judge, ../standard/rhythm.puck). It rests in `verse`, which sounds nothing; a run at
// the press (press.puck) moves it to `press` and, from the second page, `press-run`, whose layers and stingers the
// press's cues bring in.
